gcuM(){return"Six parts can cost points: order trend (up to 40: no orders, or orders falling against the week or month before), sign-ins and activity (up to 20: nobody signing in, or orders on very few days), billing (up to 45: locked, paused, cancellation scheduled, past due, or a trial about to end with no plan chosen), setup (up to 10: the checklist is not finished), feature breadth (up to 5: only one or two parts of the product in use) and card payments (up to 5: Fold Pay charges failing)."},
gcuP(){return"A store under 14 days old has no order trend to read, so it is scored on setup progress instead: 7 points for each of the four checklist steps not done. Order trend and feature breadth are not scored for it."},
cuL(a,b,c){var s=""+c
return"Bands: Healthy from "+a+" to 100, Watch from "+b+", At risk from "+s+", Critical below "+s+"."},
gcuK(){return"Alerts come from the same numbers. Snoozing an alert hides it for the days you choose; acknowledging hides it until it clears. Neither changes the score or the band. A locked or paused store gets no alerts, but it still has a score."},
gcuN(){return"The numbers are worked out for every store at once and kept for 5 minutes. Order counts use each store's own calendar and never include today. The 7-day change and the trend come from one row saved per store per day."},
